c knee osteoarthritis</article-title><source>Arthritis Rheum</source><year>2000</year><volume>43</volume><fpage>995</fpage><lpage>1000</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10817551</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/1529-0131(200005)43:5&#x0003c;995::AID-ANR6&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-1</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Reijman</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Pols</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name><name><surname>Bergink</surname><given-names>AP</given-names></name><name><surname>Hazes</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Belo</surname><given-names>JN</given-names></name><name><surname>Lievense</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Bierma-Zeinstra</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Body mass index associated with onset and progression of osteoarthritis of the knee but not of the hip. The Rotterdam Study</article-title><source>Ann Rheum Dis</source><year>2007</year><volume>66</volume><fpage>158</fpage><lpage>62</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16837490</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/ard.2006.053538</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Woolf</surname><given-names>AD</given-names></name><name><surname>Breedveld</surname><given-names>FC</given-names></name><name><surname>Kvien</surname><given-names>TK</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Controlling the obesity epidemic is important for maintaining musculoskeletal health</article-title><source>Ann Rheum Dis</source><year>2006</year><volume>65</volume><fpage>1401</fpage><lpage>1402</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17038450</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/ard.2006.058172</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surn